          "title": "You'll want to know: la solidaridad",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la solidaridad — \"the solidarity\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Necesitamos más solidaridad. We need more solidarity."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Solidario — caring, ready to help."
